    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Briscas: The Game&quot;</strong> draws from its Spanish roots and adds a fresh art twist, offering a simple yet engaging card game experience. Featuring cool pixel-art visuals and easy-to-jump-into online 1v1 and 2v2 matches, it\u2019s all about quick thinking and fun competition. Whether you\u2019re new to the game or a long-time fan, &quot;Briscas: The Game&quot; offers a laid-back yet exciting experience. Grab your friends and see who comes out on top!</p>",
